  "88f0aa2f-bbd8-4a44-8c35-e7b49c951f9a"],
 " is one half of the sum over every ordered pair of distinct positions."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"16478a59-d2d2-4dde-9259-f2a0b4a2dbd2"],

